AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_5001463> "A subdivision of the autopod consisting of manual digit 1 plus the region incorporating a single metapodial element. These segments are typically repeated along the pre-axiom to post-axial axis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/458") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_5001463> "this class represents a series of phalanges plus a metapodial element plus associated soft tissues. Instances of this class typically do not form a distinct unit.")
